{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set collared = get_nearby_collared_actors(npc.UUID) %}
{{speakingNpc.name}} unclips a leash from one specific collared person nearby. Ends that leash completely. Not for escaping their own leash, and not for handing a leash to someone else.
Available targets: {{ collared.actorsNameString }}. Never pick anyone not listed. Never pick yourself.
